## 🔒 Security

Pramaan follows a defense-in-depth approach rather than claiming to be unbreachable:

- No centralized data store — each department retains its own data
- Short-lived, single-use cryptographic proofs
- Hardware-backed key storage on the client
- AI never has final authority — a deterministic rules engine approves every action
- Tamper-evident, independently verifiable audit log

Full threat model and mitigations in [`SECURITY.md`](./SECURITY.md).

